Scope:

- Original application code, documentation and configuration of this repository
  by `kindred-98`: `Web/scripts/`, `Web/styles/`, the root HTML pages and the
  Markdown documents at the root.
- `CreacionesNuevas/`: each demo folder ships its own `LICENSE` (MIT, by the
  contributor). The root `CreacionesNuevas/LICENSE` is the file that gets injected
  into each demo's download ZIP.
- `creaciones-primium/`: the collection's own `LICENSE` (MIT, by its two
  authors) covers every demo in that folder. The root license of this repo
  does NOT grant any additional rights over them.
- `DavokerDiseñador/`: 119 demos by a third author. Their `LICENSE` (MIT, by
  davoker) covers them. They are downloadable through the build pipeline; the
  zips generated at deploy time include the MIT notice.
- `Web/assets/fonts/`: SIL Open Font License 1.1, included as `OFL-*.txt` in the
  same folder.
- **Out of scope:** third-party assets, images and remote resources referenced
  from a demo, and material of third parties that has been removed from the
  repository. See `Docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` for the full inventory.

